<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 3,619 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 1,400 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  155   (140 and 151)</p>
<p>    Good		unq   (unq and 110)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     148   (137 and 104)</p>
<p>    Medium	    142   (128 and  93)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	110   (107 and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 157 pence for an Zimbabwe PD.</p>
</text>
